  "problems": [
    "First item (MS5120W, USD 29.99) seemed not to add: the listing Add to Cart showed no change, and the product-page Add to Cart went to a cart page that rendered 'Your cart is empty' (exported as empty-cart). The item then showed up in the cart after the second item's add, so it was added late, and it's unclear which click added it. Both cart items were the operator's own, so cart-2items has no lingering items.",
    "cart-1 and cart-qty2 were reached by removing MS5120W from the 2-item cart, then incrementing WM126 to 2.",
    "The cart page showed a delivery ZIP the site chose; it was not changed.",
    "Cookie banner had no decline control reachable in the accessibility tree; left alone.",
    "robots.txt: /*/cart/* and /*/buy/* disallowed for *; the cart path /purchase/cart/en-us matches /*/cart/*. checkoutDisallowed was inferred from /*/buy/*, and no checkout path was visited.",
    "The first tabs_create failed with a tab-cap error; tabs_context was called once, and the retry succeeded (tab-13). No other tab was touched.",
    "Clicks after the first export used screenshot coordinates (trash icon, + and Remove items), because find returned no refs for the cart's controls."
  ],
